      "name": "prepare-for-handover",
      "title": "Prepare for a handover",
      "description": "Prepare for a handover: commit and push everything you hold, then write a handover report that cites the commits. Use it when told a stall, timeout or container loss is coming (\"you may stall in N minutes\"), before a long or risky step, or whenever a steward or the owner says \"prepare for handover\". It is the producing half; `handover-report` is the format and `stalled-agent-triage` is the reader.",
